  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting legal rights and protection of Palestinians in the West Bank and Gaza</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project provides funding to the Norwegian Refugee Council (NRC) to deliver legal aid and protection programmes across Palestine through its Information, Counselling and Legal Assistance (ICLA) programme. It also supports a protection-centred humanitarian response to prevent the forcible transfer of vulnerable Palestinians in the West Bank and East Jerusalem.</narrative>
  </description>
